NOTES - DRAFT 0.2 (OPTION C2)\P1. Units mm. Room sizes are CLEAR INTERNAL (finished face to finished face); overall dimensions are EXTERNAL. GIA per dwelling 104.13 m2 (NDSS para 8: internal faces of perimeter walls, incl. partitions). Building footp
  3
rint 18.60 x 12.30 m = 228.78 m2. Dwelling B mirrors dwelling A about the party-wall centreline.\P2. Accessibility target M4(2) - an optional requirement that applies only where a planning condition requires it (ADM Vol 1 para 0.3). Bathroom A: bath,
  3
 WC and basin to ADM Diagram 2.5 with provision for a future level-access shower at the bath position; bathroom door opens outward (2.27d). Living-room principal window sill max 850 mm (2.24c). Conservatory door 1,000 opening (approx. 850 clear).\P3.
  3
 Ventilation: MVHR (ADF 2021 paras 1.67-1.73). Unit allowance in utility/plant; duct routes TBD (roof not designed). Purge ventilation by openable windows and the rooflight.\P4. Rooflight over living/dining approx. 1.0 m2 net glazing, openable, solar
  3
-control glazing and external blind. Size and position subject to daylight (BS EN 17037) and overheating (ADO / TM59) assessment.\P5. Food storage: tall larder units in the kitchen (no walk-in pantry).\P6. PROVISIONAL (not yet supported by evidence):
  3
 wall build-ups 300/200/100; orientation (north assumed); conservatory size (S-08 2.5 x 1.5 m); porches, patios, 1.5 m paths and all external works. Site boundary NOT SHOWN (no survey). Battery storage location NOT SHOWN.\P7. Concept drawing only. Ge
  1
ometry tested by script; NOT a planning, Building Regulations (Parts B, E, F, K, L, M, O) or fire-safety compliance claim. Professional review required.\P8. Draft 0.1 is retained unchanged (MMUCO_ORION_Duplex_Floor_Plan.dxf).
